# Build context for the origin image (Dockerfile, deployed by fly.toml).
#
# The Dockerfile copies named paths only, never `COPY . .`, so this file is the
# second line of defense rather than the only one. It still matters: anything
# left in the context is one careless `COPY` away from an image layer, and an
# image layer outlives the file it came from. `maxey0_ss/settings.py` loads
# `<repo>/.env` automatically at start-up, so a `.env` that reached the image
# would be both baked into a pushed layer and silently used as configuration.

# --- Secrets. Never in the context, at any depth. --------------------------
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
# The one dotenv file that is documentation, not configuration. It carries no
# values (tests/test_configuration.py enforces that) and stays available.
!.env.example
config/credentials.json
**/credentials.json
# cloudflared's locally-managed tunnel credentials and origin certificate. The
# Fly Machine uses a remotely-managed tunnel token supplied by `fly secrets`.
**/.cloudflared/
**/cert.pem
*.pem
*.key
fly.secrets*

# --- Version control, local environments, caches. --------------------------
.git/
.venv/
venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
.claude/
**/.wrangler/
**/node_modules/

# --- Build output and run output the origin does not serve. ----------------
# The App bundle under mcp_apps/super_space_react/dist/ is gitignored and may
# be stale or absent on the building machine; the image takes the tracked,
# byte-identical edge copy instead (see the Dockerfile).
dist/
mcp_apps/super_space_react/dist/
server/maxey0_studio/static/app/
experiments/

# --- Trees the origin never reads. Kept out to keep the context small. -----
plugins/
ui/
site/
sdks/
